{"id":8791578652,"name":"Pordier at War","desc":"Pordier at War is a first-person shooter inspired by the First World War and works of high fantasy. Every match is set in a unique, procedurally generated landscape where players work to push the front for advances that can be measured in meters. Utilizing building and trench digging mechanics, players exploit the terrain and adapt with an ever-changing destructible environment.\n\nThis experience contains flashing lights and may be unfit for photosensitive users.\n\nSpecial thanks to...\nAsayano_ - Art\ndarkdarkdrk - Sounds\ngello765 - Models & other assets\nRaiderAnimates - Animations\n\nLatest version: pav.02.06","path":"/game/8791578652-pordier-at-war","slug":"8791578652-pordier-at-war","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/a5c4ab1f1dca80c935c3243b0651c4e277040646e5bb2f1ada8c5964b47249c1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a046b9170e0c18e9b1a71bd589303a66/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":129,"visitor":5655246,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-01T01:59:43.446Z","creator":{"name":"Ordnance Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Pordier-at-War-Ryn-War-158300","_id":"69c896dfb6e469217ed118b5","title":"Ryn War","game":{"_id":"697d540d28b1bd57ab87b572","gameId":8791578652,"name":"Pordier at War","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8791578652},"features":"[Ryn Hub | Pordier AT WAR]\nThis is part of an ongoing project, so I appreciate your patience! I’m working hard to improve it every day. If you encounter any bugs or have suggestions, please don’t hesitate to report them through our community.\n\nMain Features\nUniversal Aimbot: Includes three lock modes — Rage (CFrame-based for maximum precision), Legit (Mouse-Rel for a natural look), and Smooth (Lerp-based). Comes with FOV Circle, Alive Check, and Team Check.\n\nPlayer ESP: Enemy highlights with customizable colors, including Rainbow and Pulse modes, with Team Check support.\n\nFlag ESP: Marks enemy-controlled flags in real time and automatically updates on ownership change.\n\nGrenade ESP: Detects active grenades with a dynamic, distance-based warning.\n\nVehicle ESP: Highlights active enemy vehicles and automatically ignores destroyed ones.\n\nBig Head: Increases enemy head size for easier targeting, fully adjustable.\n\nGhost / Backtrack: Renders previous player positions with configurable delay and ping support.\n\nMouse Cursor: Custom emoji cursor with trail and orbit effects.\n\nPerformance & Visuals: Includes FPS Boost, RTX-style shaders, and Motion Blur based on camera movement.\n\nFreecam: Free camera with adjustable speed (Toggle: Shift + P).\n\nPanic Button: Instantly disables all active features.\n\nImportant:\nIf you find any issues, please let me know before leaving a bad review. I’m constantly updating the logic to keep it functional and safe.\n\nKey System:\nJoin our Discord to get the key. It’s a simple process: find the key channel, and you’re ready to test the script!\n\nCredits:\nCredits to Exunys for the original aimbot framework base.","tags":["Pordier At War","War","Ryn","Rynthara","Aimbot"],"script":"--[[ \n    Pordier At War\n    Based on old open source script (ExunysDeveloperAimbot) // Basado en un open source viejo (ExunysDeveloperAimbot)\n    All credits for ExunysDeveloperAimbot & Todos los creditos para ExunysDeveloperAimbot\n    Modified & maintained by Rýnthara // Modificado & Mantenido por Rýnthara\n    Not for sale! & No en venta!\n]] loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rynthara/MyScripts/refs/heads/main/RynWar\"))()\n-- This script is provided for educational purposes only.\n-- Este script se comparte con fines educativos.","owner":{"_id":"698d0ce4839c20a317c07ca0","username":"Rynthara","verified":false,"prof